  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After a face saving draw with Fang Zheng, Wei Wu Shang transmits that Fairy Bi Xia has many admirers and that Fang Zheng’s closeness to her will draw trouble. He lists four further competitors: Heaven River Chen Da Jiang, Rising Purple Lightning Gu Ting, Nine Death Sorrowful Wind Tang Ru Qi, and Tigress Zhao Shu Ye.",
      "chapters": [
        341
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "char_wei_wu_shang",
        "char_fairy_bi_xia",
        "char_chen_da_jiang",
        "char_gu_ting",
        "char_tang_ru_qi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When divine bean soldiers appear, Zhao Shu Ye asks what caused the sudden outbreak, then joins Xiao Qi Xing’s temporary force to fight them after Chen Da Jiang and Sun Yao agree.",
      "chapters": [
        2011
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "joins-the-temporary-force",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_xiao_qi_xing",
        "char_sun_yao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Xiao Qi Xing’s side clears one painting of yellow bean divine soldiers, Zhao Shu Ye rolls eyes at his victory show and does not reply, while the group presses on into further fighting.",
      "chapters": [
        2012
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "after-yellow-bean-soldiers",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a newly added growling beast painting world, Zhao Shu Ye stands on a boulder and commands about a hundred craftsmen building a camp. Fairy Bi Xia praises craftsman Gu’s broad use; Zhao Shu Ye answers proudly that Bi Xia chose well, that craftsman Gu can process immortal materials, build Gu houses, and refine Gu, and that a labor union token Gu setup (union head Gu, supervisor Gu, and leftover vice union head Gu) spreads the control burden. When beasts attack the unfinished camp, Zhao Shu Ye says Xiao Qi Xing and the others can handle it.",
      "chapters": [
        2081
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "craftsman-camp",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_craftsman_gu",
        "sys_gu_house",
        "gu_labor_union_token_gu",
        "gu_union_head_gu",
        "gu_supervisor_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
